<title>USA: Smith Corona plan to be approved.</title>
<headline>Smith Corona plan to be approved.</headline>
<byline>Rita Farrell</byline>
<dateline>WILMINGTON, Del. 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>A U.S. federal judge on Monday said she would approve Smith Corona Corp's plan for emerging from Chapter 11 bankruptcy protection.</p>
<p>In a ruling from the bench, U.S. Bankruptcy Judge Helen Balick overruled objections raised by Chase Manhattan Bank, the agent for the banks that provided Smith Corona's debtor-in-possession financing.</p>
</text>
